BetterYYSLS
===========

This project is a modified version of the BetterGI framework.

Upstream project
----------------
better-genshin-impact
https://github.com/babalae/better-genshin-impact
License: GNU General Public License v3.0

Modifications
-------------
- Removed game-specific features, recognition assets and related pages.
- Retained only the framework: window capture, input simulation, recognition
  primitives, mask window, trigger dispatcher, configuration and four pages.
- Renamed the project and namespaces to BetterYYSLS.
- Replaced the logo and banner assets.
- Retargeted the main project to .NET 10.
- Removed the original Git history and started a new repository history.

Third-party subprojects
-----------------------
Fischless.GameCapture, Fischless.HotkeyCapture, Fischless.KeyboardCapture and
Fischless.WindowsInput are distributed as part of the BetterGI framework.
Their own license files, where present (for example
Fischless.WindowsInput/LICENSE.txt), are retained.

